window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Everything that could go wrong—</b><b><i>did</i></b><b>.</b></p> <p>Kade’s loyalties are tangled in something far more treacherous than any of us realized.</p> <p>Reese seems desperate to make amends, and I hate to say, he’s growing on me.</p> <p>And Artemis….</p> <p>Well, she won’t wake up. According to Gabriel, she might not ever. </p> <p>There has to be a cure—but only if I keep a level head. Grief and anger crash inside me, and if I lose my cool, I might lose her, too.</p> <p>--</p> <p><i>Nemesis must be listened to prior to Warrior for continuity.</i></p>"; 
